Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.12,0:00:11.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}克拉克森的农场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.96,0:00:18.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第二十四集 计算
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.28,0:00:36.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Driest February ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.28,0:00:36.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有史以来最干燥的二月
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.92,0:00:39.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Wettest March for 40 years. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.92,0:00:39.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 四十年来最潮湿的三月 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.52,0:00:45.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Then it didn't rain at all but was cold in May.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.52,0:00:43.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}五月一点雨都没下...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.40,0:00:45.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 五月 - ...但非常冷
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.60,0:00:50.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Then it went to the hottest June ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.60,0:00:50.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后是有史以来最热的六月
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.44,0:00:55.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Since then, it's been... The wettest July.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.44,0:00:54.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在那之后 是...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.20,0:00:55.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}最潮湿的七月
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.44,0:00:59.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- The wettest July and the coldest. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.44,0:00:59.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 最潮湿且最冷的七月 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.24,0:01:05.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Given that the weather had done the exact opposite
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.24,0:01:05.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}鉴于整年的天气
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.28,0:01:07.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}of what we needed all year long,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.28,0:01:07.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一直与我们的期望背道而驰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.28,0:01:12.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we were praying for an old-fashioned autumn
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.28,0:01:14.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们祈祷能有一个传统 且阳光明媚的秋天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.56,0:01:14.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}with lots of warm sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.56,0:01:16.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But no.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.56,0:01:21.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但事与愿违 关键的收获月也拒绝配合
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.80,0:01:21.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The crucial harvesting month was also refusing to play ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.84,0:01:24.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Today was meant to be sunny. Look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.84,0:01:24.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}今天不会出太阳 你看这天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.00,0:01:29.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And now Kaleb had killed the crops off
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.00,0:01:31.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在 卡莱布已经割倒了庄稼 让其为联合收割机做好准备
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.24,0:01:31.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to ready them for the combine,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.48,0:01:32.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the clock was ticking.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.48,0:01:32.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}时间紧迫
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.08,0:01:40.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The longer they sat in the field too wet to harvest,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.08,0:01:40.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}田地过于潮湿 则无法收割 而庄稼在这种地里的时间越长
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.24,0:01:43.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the more they would deteriorate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.24,0:01:43.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}腐烂程度越严重
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.76,0:01:46.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We need under 15.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.76,0:01:46.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们需要达到15以下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.04,0:01:48.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}18.4.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.04,0:01:49.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}18.4 该死
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.92,0:01:49.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.84,0:01:53.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We're probably okay at nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.84,0:01:53.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}达到九或许也行
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.00,0:01:55.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}18.3.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.00,0:01:55.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}18.3
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.20,0:01:58.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It has to be less than nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.20,0:01:58.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}必须低于九
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.72,0:02:01.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}17.5. Bollocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.72,0:02:01.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}17.5 烦人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.76,0:02:03.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hi. Have you done a moisture test?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.76,0:02:03.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}嗨 你做了水分检测吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.04,0:02:05.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I can feel it's wet already.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.04,0:02:05.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我已经能感觉到地很潮湿了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.88,0:02:07.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}18.6.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.88,0:02:07.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}18.6
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.16,0:02:09.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This year's an absolute pig. It just won't dry at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.16,0:02:09.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}今年糟透了 根本就干不了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.48,0:02:12.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- What is it? 17%.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.48,0:02:12.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 怎么样? - 17%
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.44,0:02:17.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I think I've broken a record of how many times I can moisture test a field.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.44,0:02:17.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得我已经打破了在一块田地里 进行水分检测的次数的记录
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.88,0:02:22.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Moisture test, moisture test, then moisture test again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.88,0:02:22.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}水分检测
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.24,0:02:24.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Then do another moisture test.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.24,0:02:24.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后再次进行水分检测 然后再测一次
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.16,0:02:32.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Get to the end of the day and go, no, it's not gonna go today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.16,0:02:32.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}到了一天结束时却说:“今天不行”
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.72,0:02:35.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}To add to the pressure,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.72,0:02:35.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}除了水分检测的压力
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.04,0:02:36.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Andy Cato was now worried about how well
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.04,0:02:36.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}安迪卡托现在担心
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.80,0:02:41.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}his wild-farmed wheat field would perform...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.80,0:02:41.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}野生种植的小麦田的表现...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.08,0:02:44.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Morning. How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.08,0:02:44.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 早上好 你好吗? - 你好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.44,0:02:47.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because he feared he'd been too conservative
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.44,0:02:49.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}...因为他担心 自己对氮肥的使用过于保守
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.20,0:02:49.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}with the nitrogen fertiliser.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.60,0:02:52.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't think we've got it quite right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.60,0:02:52.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得我们用量不够
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.56,0:02:53.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We've ended up using an absolutely miniscule amount of nitrogen here,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.56,0:02:53.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们最终在这块地里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.80,0:02:58.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}about 11 kilos.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.80,0:02:58.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}使用了很少量的氮肥 大约11千克
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.68,0:03:00.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How much have you put on that field over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.68,0:03:00.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你在那块地里施了多少氮肥?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.72,0:03:02.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- No idea. - A couple of hundred maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.72,0:03:02.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 不知道 - 可能几百千克吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.20,0:03:03.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Kaleb knows. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.20,0:03:03.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 卡莱布知道 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.76,0:03:05.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So a couple of hundred kilos on that, and 11...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.76,0:03:05.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以那块地里几百千克 而11...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.76,0:03:07.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't know, but I guess it'd be somewhere around there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.76,0:03:07.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我不知道... - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.16,0:03:12.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But I think we haven't quite got the balance quite right in this field.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.16,0:03:08.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}...但我觉得差不多
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.88,0:03:12.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我觉得我们还没在这块地里 达到适当的平衡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.16,0:03:13.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We've undercooked it a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.16,0:03:13.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们施肥施得不够
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.40,0:03:16.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's just a little bit lacking in energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.40,0:03:16.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}缺少了一点能量
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.28,0:03:24.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}After sitting on our hands for day after frustrating day,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.28,0:03:24.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}经历了沮丧而无事可做的一天后
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.04,0:03:28.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}conditions did finally start to improve.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.04,0:03:28.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}情况终于开始好转
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.00,0:03:31.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It sounds better.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.00,0:03:31.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}听起来好多了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.16,0:03:35.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oats...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.16,0:03:36.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}燕麦 我们需要低于15%
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.28,0:03:37.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We need under 15%.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.44,0:03:40.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}15% now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.44,0:03:40.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在是15%
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.88,0:03:44.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So by the time Simon gets here, that'll be fit to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.88,0:03:44.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以等西蒙到这里时 我们就可以开工了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.28,0:03:50.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}As usual, Charlie had gone on holiday for the harvest.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.28,0:03:50.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}像往常一样 查理在收获季去度假了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.36,0:03:53.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This meant Kaleb was fully in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.36,0:03:53.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这意味着卡莱布全权负责
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.20,0:03:56.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, while we waited for the combine to arrive,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.20,0:03:56.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 在我们等待联合收割机到来时
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.08,0:03:59.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}he summoned me to his office
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.08,0:04:02.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他把我叫去他的办公室 说要召开一次重要的会议
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.20,0:04:02.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}for what he said was an important meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.32,0:04:09.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hey-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.32,0:04:09.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.40,0:04:10.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.40,0:04:10.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以这是...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.72,0:04:13.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Welcome to my office!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.72,0:04:13.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}欢迎来到我的办公室
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.20,0:04:15.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, how long have you had this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.20,0:04:15.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你什么时候建的这个办公室?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.88,0:04:17.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, since you made me farm manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.88,0:04:17.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}自从你让我当农场经理后
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.00,0:04:20.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, that's months ago. I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.00,0:04:20.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那是几个月前 - 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.48,0:04:22.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I just cleared a bit of space and...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.48,0:04:22.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我只是清理了一些空间 然后...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.32,0:04:25.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Who's done your interior decoration? Nicky Haslam, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.32,0:04:25.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}谁给你做的室内装饰? 尼基哈斯拉姆吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.36,0:04:26.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.36,0:04:26.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 我自己弄的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.16,0:04:29.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- It's a work's office.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.16,0:04:29.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是工作用的办公室
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.88,0:04:32.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's not an office. - It's good!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.88,0:04:32.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 这都是些什么? - 这很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.92,0:04:35.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I found this table out the old shed at the back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.92,0:04:35.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我在后面的旧棚子里找到了这张桌子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.72,0:04:39.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And this one here is actually just like a dresser with some...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.72,0:04:39.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还有这个 其实是梳妆台和一些...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.04,0:04:40.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The electric's not the best in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.04,0:04:40.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这里的电力不太行
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.12,0:04:43.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's the shittest office I've ever been in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.12,0:04:43.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 这是我进过的最差的办公室 - 不是 这里很干燥...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.88,0:04:46.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- It's not! It's dry. - You've got a washing machine, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.88,0:04:48.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 不过你有洗衣机 - 对 还有滚筒式烘干机
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.76,0:04:47.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, and a tumble dryer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.68,0:04:50.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Anyway, more importantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.68,0:04:50.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}总之 更重要的是 查理在美国
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.24,0:04:52.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Charlie's in the U.S. of A. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.24,0:04:52.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我知道 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.92,0:04:54.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Harvest is around the corner, so obviously he's gone away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.92,0:04:54.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}收获季即将到来 所以他走了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.92,0:04:56.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Exactly. So he's gone away. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.92,0:04:56.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 没错 他离开了 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.52,0:04:58.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But as farm manager now,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.52,0:04:58.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但作为现任农场经理
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.52,0:05:00.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}it makes me responsible for the health and safety on this farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.52,0:05:00.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我需要对这里的健康和安全负责
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.68,0:05:01.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, God...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.68,0:05:01.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.80,0:05:04.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ten minutes. That's all it's gonna take. I've gotta go through this folder.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.80,0:05:04.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}只需要十分钟 我得过一遍这个
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.56,0:05:05.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- What is it? - You can read it if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.56,0:05:05.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.48,0:05:08.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Read all the risk assessments that I've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.48,0:05:08.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}阅读所有风险评估之类的东西 就像我之前那样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.00,0:05:10.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Have you done risk assessments? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.00,0:05:10.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你做了风险评估吗? - 做过
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.92,0:05:12.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I had to. It's on my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.92,0:05:12.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我必须做 因为这是我的职责 如果你现在弄伤了自己
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.16,0:05:15.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If you injure yourself now, do you know whose fault it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.16,0:05:16.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你知道这是谁的错吗? 我的 我会进监狱
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.00,0:05:16.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Mine. I go to prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.44,0:05:18.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And this face isn't for prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.44,0:05:18.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这张脸可不适合在监狱里待着
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.36,0:05:20.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The other day we were carting stone for the car park, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.36,0:05:20.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那天 我们在给停车场
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.36,0:05:22.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.36,0:05:22.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 切割石头 对吧? - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.12,0:05:25.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What happened when you pulled up to the drive off the car?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.12,0:05:25.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你把车开出停车场时发生了什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.00,0:05:27.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Oh, the trailer came up. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.00,0:05:27.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 拖车来了 然后... - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.16,0:05:29.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- That's quite dangerous, though. Why is it dangerous?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.16,0:05:28.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那样很危险
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.32,0:05:29.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 如果头顶... - 为什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.56,0:05:31.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The overhead power cables... - There aren't any.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.56,0:05:31.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 头顶有电缆 - 没有
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.96,0:05:33.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay, there isn't any, but if there was...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.96,0:05:33.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧 确实没有 但如果有的话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.76,0:05:35.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, there isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.76,0:05:35.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你不会意识到... - 没有电缆
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.40,0:05:38.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You could have taken them out and killed yourself or somebody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.40,0:05:38.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你可能会挂到电缆 然后害死你自己或其他人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.72,0:05:39.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But there isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.72,0:05:39.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但那里没有电缆
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.68,0:05:42.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Do you know the correct way to get out of a tractor if you've hit a power cable?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.68,0:05:42.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果触碰到电缆 你知道该怎么从拖拉机里出来吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.72,0:05:46.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- No. The correct way
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.72,0:05:46.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 不知道 - 在触碰到电缆时
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.48,0:05:49.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to get out of a tractor if you've touched a power cable,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.48,0:05:49.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}从拖拉机出来的正确方式 因为电缆会让你的拖拉机通电
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.24,0:05:51.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because it will shoot through your tractor,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.24,0:05:52.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是你要蹲跳下车
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.60,0:05:52.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}is to bunny hop.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.64,0:05:55.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Open the door, top step, and just jump
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.64,0:05:56.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}打开车门 上到最顶部 然后尽可能地跳离它
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.32,0:05:56.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}as far as you can away from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.88,0:05:57.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I can't bunny hop. You'd probably break your leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.88,0:05:57.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不能蹲跳
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.80,0:06:01.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And my knees are not up to any...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.80,0:05:59.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果你跳下车 可能会摔断腿
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.88,0:06:01.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我的膝盖不能...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.56,0:06:02.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'll sit in it
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.56,0:06:02.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我会坐在车里 橡胶轮胎能让我绝缘
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.84,0:06:04.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because the rubber tyres will insulate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.84,0:06:06.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那你就不能给我打电话了 因为没有信号
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.32,0:06:06.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But you can't ring me then because there's no signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.64,0:06:07.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.64,0:06:07.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}为什么不行?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.52,0:06:09.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because the electricity will knock out your signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.52,0:06:09.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}电会干扰你的信号
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.68,0:06:11.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}People will miss me after a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.68,0:06:11.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不过 过不了一会儿大家就会想起我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.80,0:06:13.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- No, I wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.80,0:06:13.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不会
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.28,0:06:17.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Anyway. Have you got What3Words on your phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.28,0:06:17.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}总之 你手机上 安装“三词地址”应用程序了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.80,0:06:18.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. - OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.80,0:06:18.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 安了 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.80,0:06:22.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Just in case of an accident, you can tell me what specific three words
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.80,0:06:22.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}万一发生意外 你可以告诉我具体的三个词
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.04,0:06:23.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and I know where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.04,0:06:23.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我会知道你的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.44,0:06:26.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't understand What3Words. I thought you had to choose the words.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.44,0:06:26.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不知道这个“三词地址”该怎么用 我以为你必须选择词语
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.24,0:06:27.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.24,0:06:27.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 不是 - 因为它说
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.24,0:06:30.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It said, "You choose three words for wherever you are."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.24,0:06:30.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“你可以在任何地方选择三个词” 我就心想:“怎么...”
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.40,0:06:32.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But I thought if I send that to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.40,0:06:35.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果我把那个发给你 你怎么知道我选择了哪三个词?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.80,0:06:35.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}how do you know what three words I've chosen?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.88,0:06:38.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm gonna warm this one up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.88,0:06:38.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我要热热手掌 然后这样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.60,0:06:42.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I genuinely... I promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.60,0:06:42.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我以为...我发誓 - 所以基本上...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.24,0:06:43.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, basically...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.24,0:06:46.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我说实话...我在手机上安装了 然后它说随便
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.20,0:06:46.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Honestly. I've got it on the phone and it said...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.24,0:06:49.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Whatever... Walnut, toffee, cat. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.24,0:06:49.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 核桃、太妃糖、猫 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.16,0:06:52.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, I don't want those words.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.16,0:06:52.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 我不想要这些词 这是其他人选出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.32,0:06:54.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Somebody else has chosen them. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.32,0:06:55.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 我不喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.04,0:06:55.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, I don't like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.64,0:06:57.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I write newspaper columns.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.64,0:06:57.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我写报纸专栏 没人给它们选词
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.00,0:06:59.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Nobody chooses the words for them. I choose the words.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.00,0:06:59.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我自己选词
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.64,0:07:02.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, so the person who wrote this What3Word programme
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.64,0:07:02.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 但是...所以编写 这个应用程序的人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.68,0:07:04.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}chose the words for each place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.68,0:07:04.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 给每个地方选择了词 - 对 我已经知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.20,0:07:06.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, I've got it anyway. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.20,0:07:06.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}很好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.40,0:07:08.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All right. At random.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.40,0:07:08.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好的 随机挑选 - 荒唐
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.08,0:07:11.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"No smoking when refuelling"?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.08,0:07:11.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-“加油时不能抽烟”? - 不行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.16,0:07:13.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No. - I never knew that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.16,0:07:13.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我一直不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.68,0:07:17.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I always used to light up when I was filling up the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.68,0:07:17.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我总是在给车加油时使用打火机
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.04,0:07:18.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Always.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.04,0:07:19.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 一向如此 - 你最好是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.28,0:07:19.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I wish you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.52,0:07:26.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}A couple of hours later,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.52,0:07:29.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}几小时后 卡莱布与西蒙 和他的联合收割机汇合
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.24,0:07:28.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Kaleb met up with Simon and his combine
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.00,0:07:31.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to harvest the oats he'd planted in the fields
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.00,0:07:33.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}开始收割在油菜种植失败的地里 种植的燕麦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.84,0:07:33.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}where the rape had failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.80,0:07:36.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Have you got a walkie-talkie, Simon?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.80,0:07:36.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你有对讲机吗 西蒙?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.00,0:07:38.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, I've got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.00,0:07:38.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有 我能听到你说话
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.44,0:07:44.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And I suspect he was hoping to get it all done
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.44,0:07:45.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我怀疑他想在没有我的帮助下 收割完所有燕麦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.44,0:07:45.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}without my help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.56,0:07:50.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I think he's hoping I won't find him but I shall.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.56,0:07:50.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得他不想让我找到他 但我会找到他的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.32,0:07:54.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Then I shall offer my assistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.32,0:07:55.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后我会帮忙 他会开心的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.08,0:07:55.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And he will be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.56,0:07:59.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Good news! I'm here to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.56,0:07:59.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好消息 我来帮忙了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.36,0:08:01.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh no...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.36,0:08:01.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.28,0:08:06.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You can have this trailer, I'll have the other one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.28,0:08:06.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你可以开这辆拖车 我有另一辆拖车 好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.72,0:08:09.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The trailer Kaleb wanted me to use
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.72,0:08:11.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布想让我用的那辆拖车 只装满了一半
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.64,0:08:11.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}was only half full.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.44,0:08:15.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So I had to hook it up and then carry on filling it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.44,0:08:15.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我不得不把挂上它 继续装
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.72,0:08:20.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Genuinely,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.72,0:08:23.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}说真的 我还是不知道如何挂拖车
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.76,0:08:23.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I still don't know how to hook a trailer up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.60,0:08:26.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Up. Go up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.60,0:08:26.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}上 往上
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.84,0:08:29.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Is that right? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.84,0:08:29.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 这对吗? - 不对
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.24,0:08:31.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Use your joystick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.24,0:08:31.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}用你的操纵杆
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.48,0:08:34.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Unlock it on the little button, the hydraulics...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.48,0:08:34.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}按一下那个小按钮解锁液压系统
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.52,0:08:36.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You need the hydraulics.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.52,0:08:37.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}需要液压系统 你都完成...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.64,0:08:37.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Use that little...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.44,0:08:40.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Is it locked or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.44,0:08:40.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它被锁住了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.00,0:08:43.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I don't bloody know. - Is it locked on the little button?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.00,0:08:44.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我不知道 什么? - 小按钮锁住了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.40,0:08:44.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.12,0:08:47.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Are we ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.12,0:08:47.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们准备好了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.04,0:08:49.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Roll forward a little bit more.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.04,0:08:50.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 稍微前进一点 - 什么?后退?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.84,0:08:51.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What? Backwards?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.24,0:08:53.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You've gotta go forward a little tiny bit. Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.24,0:08:53.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你得往前开一点
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.88,0:08:57.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How can they refuel a fighter jet
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.88,0:08:59.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}人们怎么做到在九千米的高空 给战斗机加油
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.00,0:08:59.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}in mid-air at 30,000 feet
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.12,0:09:00.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and yet somehow, farmers have not yet invented
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.12,0:09:00.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 然而 农民... - 好了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.96,0:09:03.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- an easier way... - No, you rolled forward again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.96,0:09:03.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 却还没发明出更简单的方法... - 不对 你又往前了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.76,0:09:06.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I had to roll forwards!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.76,0:09:06.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我必须前进!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.76,0:09:09.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Whoa. Shit. - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.76,0:09:09.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 该死 - 嘿!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.52,0:09:10.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Now we're cooking!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.52,0:09:10.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在对咯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.72,0:09:13.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Only took fucking three hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.72,0:09:13.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}只花了“短短”三小时呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.60,0:09:16.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right. There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.60,0:09:18.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 你想在我们开始收割前 先试试液压系统吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.28,0:09:18.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Do you wanna try your hydraulics before we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.96,0:09:20.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How do I try hydraulics?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.96,0:09:20.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我怎么试液压系统?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.48,0:09:23.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Unlock the hydraulics. - I have unlocked it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.48,0:09:23.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}解锁液压系统 然后用小操纵杆...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.04,0:09:25.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.04,0:09:25.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得我已经解锁液压系统了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.72,0:09:29.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Go down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.72,0:09:29.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}下降
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.88,0:09:31.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, no, no. Go down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.88,0:09:31.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不对 下降
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.64,0:09:39.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, you fucking...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.64,0:09:39.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}该死...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.28,0:09:47.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I honestly... I can't. I can't stand him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.28,0:09:47.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不能...我受不了他了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.32,0:09:50.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Give him a shovel and some bags. That's what did with the students.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.32,0:09:50.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}给他一把铲子和一些口袋 我们以前就是这么打发学生的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.52,0:09:52.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Make them shovel it up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.52,0:09:52.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}让他们再铲起来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.24,0:09:53.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.24,0:09:53.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 不要! - 不!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.96,0:09:55.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Fucking hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.96,0:09:55.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}该死的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.00,0:09:57.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right. That is up, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.00,0:09:57.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好吧 那是向上 - 别!停下!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.12,0:09:58.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.52,0:10:01.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.52,0:10:01.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.16,0:10:04.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Can we have an agreement...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.16,0:10:04.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们能达成协议吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.44,0:10:06.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}From now on then, you plug it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.44,0:10:06.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}从现在开始 你把它插进去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.48,0:10:10.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}When you plug those hoses in, can they always be the same?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.48,0:10:10.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}当你插入那些软管时 你总能让它们保持一致吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.12,0:10:13.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes. That's what I always do. But your tractor's shit, for one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.12,0:10:13.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}可以 我总是这样 但首先 你的拖拉机太烂了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.52,0:10:15.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're incapable of driving it, for two.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.52,0:10:15.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}其次 你不会开
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.44,0:10:17.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.44,0:10:17.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 不是我的问题 - 就是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.40,0:10:20.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, it is. Every time you jump in it, you press the wrong one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.40,0:10:20.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}每次你操纵拖拉机 总会按错键
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.20,0:10:23.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's because every time I get in it,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.20,0:10:23.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是因为我每次坐进去 每个按钮的功能都不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.00,0:10:25.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}each button does a different thing. You would agree with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.00,0:10:27.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你同意这一点吧? - 对 因为这辆拖拉机很垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.88,0:10:27.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, because it's a shit tractor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.20,0:10:34.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Luckily, my godson was doing work experience on the farm that week,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.20,0:10:34.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}幸好 我的教子 那周在农场体验干农活
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.20,0:10:37.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so he got to experience the joy
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.20,0:10:39.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以他体验了 铲起我洒的燕麦的乐趣...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.32,0:10:39.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}of shovelling up my spilled oats...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.76,0:10:41.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.76,0:10:41.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.96,0:10:43.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.96,0:10:43.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我来了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.04,0:10:48.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}While I headed over to Simon to take the rest of his load.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.04,0:10:48.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}...我朝西蒙驶去 去接剩下的燕麦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.64,0:10:52.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Now, let's not muck it up, Jeremy. Let's not muck it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.64,0:10:52.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在 杰里米 别搞砸了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.08,0:11:05.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}He's nervous now. He's all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.08,0:11:05.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他现在很紧张 手忙脚乱的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.72,0:11:08.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Go over, left a little bit. Go left! Go left!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.72,0:11:08.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}往左边一点 左边
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.28,0:11:12.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All of that just went over. Look how much...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.28,0:11:12.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所有的都洒...看看多少...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.80,0:11:14.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You've just spilt loads.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.80,0:11:14.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你刚刚洒了很多
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.80,0:11:15.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.80,0:11:17.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}什么?我现在做错了什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.92,0:11:17.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What have I done wrong now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.08,0:11:20.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You've just spilt loads and loads over the left-hand side.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.08,0:11:20.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你刚刚把很多都洒在左边了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.64,0:11:22.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You were too close.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.64,0:11:22.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你离得太近了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.52,0:11:25.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, I don't understand. I don't understand anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.52,0:11:25.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不明白 我什么都不明白
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.28,0:11:34.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}When it was time to take my next load,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.28,0:11:34.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}等到了我装下一批燕麦时
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.92,0:11:38.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Simon made a rather humiliating decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.92,0:11:38.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}西蒙做了一个相当侮辱人的决定
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.32,0:11:45.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm, I'm loading while stationary.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.32,0:11:45.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我在停车的状态下装燕麦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.12,0:11:47.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I know you can see it at home and you're laughing at me,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.12,0:11:47.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道你们在家里看到这一幕 肯定会嘲笑我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.88,0:11:50.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but the important thing is:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.88,0:11:52.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但重要的是 卡莱布没在这里看到
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.40,0:11:52.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Kaleb's not here to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.32,0:12:06.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But even though I'd lost whatever harvesting skills I'd once had,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.32,0:12:06.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但即使我已经失去了 我曾经拥有的收割技巧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.00,0:12:07.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we did manage, that day, to get both fields of oats harvested
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.00,0:12:07.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们那天还是成功地
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.88,0:12:12.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and in the shed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.88,0:12:12.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}收割了两块地里的燕麦 并装进了棚屋
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.04,0:12:15.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Eat your heart out Mac Scotland.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.04,0:12:15.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}尽情享用吧 苏格兰先生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.92,0:12:18.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We can have some Mac Chipping Norton porridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.92,0:12:18.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们可以享用一些麦基平诺顿燕麦粥
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.36,0:12:25.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}However, we couldn't savour the normal joy of harvesting
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.36,0:12:25.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然而 我们无法品尝到 收获的平常乐趣
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.20,0:12:29.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because once again, the weather reared its ugly head.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.20,0:12:29.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为天气又在作怪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.04,0:12:33.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So now we'll go into the Met Office.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.04,0:12:33.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我们现在查看气象局的天气预报
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.00,0:12:35.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They're saying 10 o'clock tonight rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.00,0:12:35.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}据说今晚十点下雨
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.52,0:12:37.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Er, mine's saying 9 o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.52,0:12:37.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我的说九点
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.32,0:12:40.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Have you got this particular app of doom?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.32,0:12:40.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你有这个末日应用程序吗? - 有
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.40,0:12:41.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Is that the Norwegian?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.40,0:12:41.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是挪威...那是哪个?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.88,0:12:44.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Which one's that one? Rain today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.88,0:12:44.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是“今日下雨”
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.24,0:12:46.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've just been looking at the BBC Met Office.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.24,0:12:46.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 我就看英国广播公司的气象预报
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.32,0:12:48.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That Norwegian one is very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.32,0:12:48.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 挪威那个很好用 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.04,0:12:51.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah. - They're all saying now 10 o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.04,0:12:51.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在天气预报说十点要...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.16,0:12:52.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- 10 o'clock? - 10 o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.16,0:12:52.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 十点? - 十点
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.52,0:12:54.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Holy shit. Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.52,0:12:54.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天啊!看看那个
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.40,0:12:56.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.40,0:12:59.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}雨水要来了 那会对我们造成超大打击
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.88,0:12:59.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And it's going to get medieval on our bottoms.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.96,0:13:04.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}With every app saying wind and rain was on the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.96,0:13:04.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}每个应用程序都说狂风暴雨即将来临
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.52,0:13:07.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Kaleb made a late-afternoon decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.52,0:13:07.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布在下午晚些时候做出了决定
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.68,0:13:11.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I think we finish this field off, because we're here anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.68,0:13:11.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们的下一个任务 是完成这块地的收割
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.20,0:13:13.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're the farm manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.20,0:13:13.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 因为反正我们刚好在这里 - 你是农场经理
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.44,0:13:15.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then we move down to the Wildfarmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.44,0:13:15.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后我们去野生农场
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.92,0:13:18.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. OK. Well, that'll keep Andy happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.92,0:13:18.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好的 那会让安迪很开心 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.16,0:13:19.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes. And get that done.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.16,0:13:19.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把那块收完
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.36,0:13:21.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I think the problem that Andy's worrying about, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.36,0:13:21.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得问题是安迪很担心...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.52,0:13:23.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Our wheat now will be fine against the weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.52,0:13:23.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们的小麦 现在应该能抵御天气的影响
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.76,0:13:26.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It'll take a little bit of battering before it loses the milling quality.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.76,0:13:26.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它遭受连续打击后 会失去磨粉品质
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.64,0:13:29.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. You mean before you can make it...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.64,0:13:29.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 在你把它做成... - 面包
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.64,0:13:31.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, you can make it into bread, not cow food.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.64,0:13:31.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把它做成面包 而不是奶牛饲料
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.48,0:13:33.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Exactly. Or chicken food.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.48,0:13:33.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 没错 或鸡饲料 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.16,0:13:37.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The problem I think he's worried about is that that's such an old variety
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.16,0:13:37.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但问题是 他很担心这是老品种燕麦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.48,0:13:40.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that he's worried about it losing the milling quality.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.48,0:13:40.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得他很担心它会失去磨粉品质
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.40,0:13:42.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Which it might in bad weather. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.40,0:13:42.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 而恶劣天气可能会导致此结果 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.48,0:13:49.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Andy had predicted that because he'd been too cautious
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.48,0:13:51.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}安迪预测 因为他对肥料的使用过于谨慎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.64,0:13:51.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}with the fertiliser,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.12,0:13:54.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}his field wouldn't produce a massive yield.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.12,0:13:54.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他的田地的产量不会很高
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.04,0:13:57.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And he wasn't wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.04,0:13:57.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他预测得没错
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.80,0:14:02.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, a third of the field
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.80,0:14:02.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}已经收割了三分之一的地
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.76,0:14:05.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and it's less than half the trailer full.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.76,0:14:05.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还不到半拖车
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.56,0:14:08.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, we're easily gonna get this field done.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.56,0:14:08.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们很容易就能收完这块地
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.00,0:14:09.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.00,0:14:09.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.40,0:14:12.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's pretty low, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.40,0:14:12.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}产量很低 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.12,0:14:13.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Is it worth doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.12,0:14:13.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 这值得吗? - 值得
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.88,0:14:16.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. You're just being awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.88,0:14:18.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就因为有人用你的地种庄稼 你一整年都很奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.00,0:14:17.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You've been awkward all year about somebody stealing your field.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.12,0:14:20.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, you shouldn't have let someone else drill my field.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.12,0:14:20.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你不应该让别人种我的地
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.24,0:14:23.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're always going to be negative so I'm not gonna listen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.24,0:14:23.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你总是很消极 所以我不会听你的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.80,0:14:25.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because I look after fellow Doncastrians.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.80,0:14:25.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为我要照顾唐卡斯特同胞
