Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.84,0:14:27.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 唐卡斯特人? - 这就是我们的称呼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.24,0:14:29.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- That's what we're called. - Dear Lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.24,0:14:31.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好家伙 我打赌你是邪教徒吧 - 他来自唐卡斯特 我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.20,0:14:31.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- He's from Donny, I'm from Donny. - I bet you're in some sort of cult!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.92,0:14:35.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Doncaster has given the world...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.92,0:14:37.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}世界闻名的凯文基冈和黛安娜里格 都来自唐卡斯特
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.52,0:14:37.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Kevin Keegan, Diana Rigg,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.28,0:14:40.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and now we're saving farming.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.28,0:14:40.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在 我们正在拯救农业
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.16,0:14:44.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm not being horrible, but I have no idea what you're on about.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.16,0:14:44.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不是要冒犯你 但我不明白你在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.92,0:14:46.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Never heard of Kevin Keegan? - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.92,0:14:46.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你没听说过凯文基冈? - 没有
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.84,0:14:48.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Was he a Prime Minister?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.84,0:14:48.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他是首相吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.88,0:14:51.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- No, he was captain footballer. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.88,0:14:51.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不是 他是一名足球队队长
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.28,0:14:53.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.36,0:15:11.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Working without a break into the night,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.36,0:15:11.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们夜以继日地工作
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.64,0:15:15.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we got Andy's wheat in just before the rain came.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.64,0:15:15.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}赶在下雨前把安迪的小麦 全部收割完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.44,0:15:24.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And the next day, this new-age mix of wheat and beans
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.44,0:15:24.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第二天 现代小麦和豆子混合田里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.20,0:15:26.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}went off to be milled.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.20,0:15:26.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}种出的小麦被送去磨粉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.48,0:15:32.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This meant we could turn our attention to the problem child...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.48,0:15:32.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这意味着我们可以 把注意力转向“问题儿童”
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.52,0:15:35.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the oilseed rape.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.52,0:15:35.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}油菜籽
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.40,0:15:41.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Now, let's just remind ourselves...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.40,0:15:41.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在 我们只需提醒自己
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.72,0:15:44.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}there's a saying which says if you haven't got your rape planted
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.72,0:15:44.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有一句谚语说 “如果你在摩顿展览会前
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.64,0:15:46.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}by the time of the Moreton Show,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.64,0:15:49.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“没种下你的油菜籽 那就不要种了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.36,0:15:49.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which is a farming show near here,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.40,0:15:52.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which is early September, don't plant it because you're too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.40,0:15:52.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“因为已经太迟了” 而此农业展览会一般在九月初举行
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.80,0:15:55.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We didn't get our rape in by the Moreton Show.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.80,0:15:55.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们没能在摩顿展览会前种下油菜籽
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.52,0:15:57.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We advised Kaleb not to plant rape.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.52,0:16:00.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们曾建议卡莱布别种 但他先斩后奏 还是种了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.80,0:15:59.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}He went ahead and planted it anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.12,0:16:01.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Most of it failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.12,0:16:01.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}大部分都失败了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.60,0:16:05.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This field didn't fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.60,0:16:07.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这块地没失败 我们等着看收成情况吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.80,0:16:07.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We're waiting to see what the yield is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.68,0:16:10.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How many fields have we got? Have we got two fields of it, haven't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.68,0:16:10.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们有几块地? 我们有两块地 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.48,0:16:13.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We normally put about 100 hectares in, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.48,0:16:13.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们通常会种一百公顷 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.84,0:16:15.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Of oilseed rape.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.84,0:16:15.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 种油菜籽? - 种油菜籽
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.48,0:16:17.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And this year we've got 20.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.48,0:16:17.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}今年 我们种了二十公顷
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.64,0:16:19.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. How much failed?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.64,0:16:19.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 因为有多少种失败了?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.16,0:16:21.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Only one field. 80 hectares. - No, two fields failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.16,0:16:20.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}只有一块地 八公顷
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.88,0:16:21.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 两块地种失败了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.92,0:16:24.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- No, one field's failed. - Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.92,0:16:24.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没有 一块地失败了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.32,0:16:25.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Say sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.32,0:16:25.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}快道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.84,0:16:30.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm sorry you planted the wrong crop.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.84,0:16:30.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对不起你种错了作物
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.16,0:16:31.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, say sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.16,0:16:31.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 说“对不起”
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.20,0:16:32.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Sorry your mistake was bigger than it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.20,0:16:32.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对不起你的错误比之前严重
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.92,0:16:33.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Be nice for one minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.92,0:16:33.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 友善待人 - 你做得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.92,0:16:36.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You've done a very good job. - Thank you.
