Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.04,0:20:42.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, I am pissed off, you are pissed off.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.04,0:20:42.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你的确看起来...我很生气 你很生气
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.56,0:20:44.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, I can see you're pissed off.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.56,0:20:44.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我能看出你很生气
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.20,0:20:46.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm just fed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.20,0:20:46.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我受够了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.56,0:20:48.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, I'd normally taunt you
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.56,0:20:48.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}花了那么多时间和精力
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.72,0:20:52.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and say you were told not to plant rape.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.72,0:20:52.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我通常会嘲讽你说 “就跟你说过别种油菜”
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.80,0:20:53.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm not in the mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.80,0:20:53.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我没这心情
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.48,0:20:56.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.48,0:20:56.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我是说 你知道...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.64,0:20:59.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Cheer up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.64,0:20:59.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 振作点 - 我已经受够了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.68,0:21:01.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, I've just had enough. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.68,0:21:01.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}怎么?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.92,0:21:04.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, you put all that time and effort in, and money.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.92,0:21:04.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你投入了所有时间、精力和金钱
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.40,0:21:06.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I know it's not my money. Okay, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.40,0:21:06.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道这不是我的钱 好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.04,0:21:10.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The 'oo-ar' bit's a joke and that lot. But it's still...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.04,0:21:10.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}以前说的那些都是笑话 但还是...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.64,0:21:13.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I still don't want it to do badly, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.64,0:21:13.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我仍然不希望收成不好 你知道吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.28,0:21:17.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'll get you a beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.28,0:21:17.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我给你拿瓶啤酒
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.92,0:21:19.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.92,0:21:19.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.92,0:21:22.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Aw, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.92,0:21:22.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.08,0:21:26.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- It's annoying though, isn't it? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.08,0:21:26.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 但这很烦人 不是吗? - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.24,0:21:30.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- And we're in this together, aren't we? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.24,0:21:30.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我们是一队的 不是吗? - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.76,0:21:32.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'll go and get the trailer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.76,0:21:32.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我去开拖车
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.20,0:21:33.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'll drop this one off and then I'll meet you back here, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.20,0:21:33.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我会把这个放下... - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.52,0:21:35.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.52,0:21:35.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- ...我在这里等你 好吗? - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.56,0:21:49.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Once the rape was in, there was a harvesting pause,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.56,0:21:49.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}油菜入库后 收割暂停
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.40,0:21:53.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so I went to London to see my new granddaughter...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.40,0:21:53.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我去伦敦看我刚出世的孙女
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.64,0:22:00.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Leaving Kaleb in charge of the now very pregnant pigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.64,0:22:00.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}让卡莱布负责照顾怀孕的猪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.92,0:22:12.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}She's very close.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.92,0:22:12.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它很快就要生产了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.16,0:22:15.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}She's extremely close. I reckon tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.16,0:22:15.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}很快 我觉得就是今晚
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.12,0:22:19.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}She wants comfort.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.12,0:22:19.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它想要安慰
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.68,0:22:25.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}A bit like going into the maternity centre with the other half.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.68,0:22:25.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有点像和你的另一半 一起去产科中心
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.72,0:22:30.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hold their hand...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.72,0:22:30.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}握住它的手
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.88,0:22:34.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Massage their back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.88,0:22:34.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}按摩后背
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.96,0:22:36.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Scratch around their ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.96,0:22:36.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}挠耳朵
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.24,0:22:40.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're okay. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.24,0:22:40.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.92,0:22:42.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, you're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.92,0:22:42.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你很好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.60,0:22:50.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Calms her down, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.60,0:22:50.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}让它冷静下来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.20,0:22:58.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The next day, the piglets started to appear.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.20,0:22:58.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第二天 猪崽开始出现
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.36,0:23:05.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Lots of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.36,0:23:05.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}很多猪崽
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.72,0:23:12.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}In fact there were so many...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.72,0:23:12.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}事实上 数量太多
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.16,0:23:19.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that Dilwyn the vet had to come along
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.16,0:23:19.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}导致迪尔翁兽医 不得不过来做一些社会工程
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.28,0:23:22.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to do a bit of social engineering.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.28,0:23:22.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}...14、15 这里16只
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.16,0:23:23.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Fifteen, sixteen in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.16,0:23:25.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是啊 太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.88,0:23:25.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, that's too many.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.76,0:23:28.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}She'll be struggling to rear more than twelve.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.76,0:23:28.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它要照顾12只以上的猪崽非常困难
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.72,0:23:30.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. Twelve, thirteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.72,0:23:30.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是的 - 12、13
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.76,0:23:33.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I think the best thing to do is to get the smaller ones
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.76,0:23:33.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得最好的办法是 把小一点的抓出来
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.44,0:23:35.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and put them over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.44,0:23:35.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把小家伙放在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.28,0:23:37.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}She is farrowing outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.28,0:23:37.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它是在外面生崽的?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.60,0:23:38.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.60,0:23:38.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.00,0:23:41.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Put them over there. That'll give them a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.00,0:23:40.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把它们放在那边
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.04,0:23:42.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那会给它们机会 看情况如何
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.00,0:23:43.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.00,0:23:43.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.76,0:23:45.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.76,0:23:45.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}拿着...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.20,0:23:47.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, look at that. They are minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.20,0:23:47.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好 看看这只 它们好小
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.64,0:23:48.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They're tiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.64,0:23:49.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 非常小 - 确实
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.88,0:23:50.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They are absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.56,0:23:52.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look, a mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.56,0:23:52.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}和猪妈妈一起
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.48,0:23:59.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.24,0:24:07.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's having a good feed now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.24,0:24:07.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}猪崽吃得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.48,0:24:14.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}成功了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.32,0:24:16.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's wicked, isn't it, when you see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.32,0:24:16.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}很棒吧?看看这画面
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.20,0:24:24.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}When I returned, Lisa and I rushed over to Pig City
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.20,0:24:24.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我回来时
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.20,0:24:29.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to say hello to the new arrivals.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.20,0:24:29.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}丽莎和我冲到猪猪城 跟新诞生的小猪崽问好
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.56,0:24:31.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.56,0:24:34.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.56,0:24:34.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.28,0:24:36.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look at the size of that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.28,0:24:36.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看看那只的个头
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.24,0:24:39.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They're heavy already!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.24,0:24:39.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你...你已经很重了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.08,0:24:43.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And here you are. Sucking straw.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.08,0:24:43.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看你 嘴里还有稻草
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.32,0:24:47.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, my God! There's loads!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.32,0:24:47.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天啊!好多啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.64,0:24:49.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well done!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.64,0:24:49.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}干得好!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.28,0:24:51.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We're not going to call you Swizz anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.28,0:24:51.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们不会再叫你瑞士猪了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.44,0:24:55.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}In March, Swizz gave birth to three.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.44,0:24:55.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}三月份 瑞士猪诞下了三只猪崽
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.40,0:24:58.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's right. This time, eleven.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.40,0:24:56.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没错
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.36,0:24:58.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这次 11只
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.24,0:24:59.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No! Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.24,0:24:59.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 不是吧! - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.60,0:25:01.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Swizz! Eleven.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.60,0:25:01.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 瑞士猪? - 11 只
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.32,0:25:04.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So the total number of pigs we had in March
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.32,0:25:04.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我们三月总共有28只猪崽
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.96,0:25:07.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- was 28 piglets. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.96,0:25:07.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.40,0:25:09.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This time, 53.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.40,0:25:09.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这次53只
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.60,0:25:12.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Whoa. I think that's because they're fit running up and down that hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.60,0:25:12.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得那是它们健康
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.00,0:25:13.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I think it's because they're happy because of the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.00,0:25:13.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为它们很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.24,0:25:15.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.24,0:25:15.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 因为它们在树林里 - 我也觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.16,0:25:18.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But, this is the main thing for me, you know my pig ring?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.16,0:25:18.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但这对我来说是最重要的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.00,0:25:19.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.00,0:25:19.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你知道我的猪环吗? - 知道
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.92,0:25:21.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Has it worked?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.92,0:25:21.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它有用吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.48,0:25:23.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Last time,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.48,0:25:26.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}上次28%的猪崽 被它们的妈妈压死了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.96,0:25:25.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}28% were squashed by their mothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.16,0:25:28.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Ooph. This time,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.16,0:25:29.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这次 13%
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.16,0:25:29.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}13%.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.80,0:25:31.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, that's very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.80,0:25:31.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那非常好 太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.48,0:25:34.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- That's excellent. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.48,0:25:34.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}嘿!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.04,0:25:36.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Dude! Have you seen how many piglets we've got?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.04,0:25:36.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}朋友 你看到 我们有多少只猪崽了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.24,0:25:38.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Have I seen? I was here helping deliver them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.24,0:25:38.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我看到了...我之前在这里帮忙接生
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.32,0:25:41.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'll tell you what, though. I hate to admit this, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.32,0:25:40.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我跟你们说 我不想承认
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.36,0:25:41.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}怎么?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.44,0:25:44.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Clarkson's Ring? It works.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.44,0:25:44.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}克拉克森猪环起作用了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.64,0:25:45.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.64,0:25:45.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.48,0:25:50.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, you can just see, she's pushed up here against the ring
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.48,0:25:50.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你可以看到 它靠在这里的猪环旁边
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.48,0:25:53.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and the piglets can run behind her.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.48,0:25:53.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}猪崽可以在它身后跑来跑去
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.56,0:25:55.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, that's extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.56,0:25:55.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这太了不起了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.44,0:26:05.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We then had to break off from pig midwifery
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.44,0:26:05.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后我们不得不中断 猪猪接生婆的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.08,0:26:08.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because it was time to harvest the barley.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.08,0:26:08.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为是时候收割大麦了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.24,0:26:13.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And as Charlie had feared...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.24,0:26:13.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}正如查理担心的那样...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.60,0:26:16.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You know it went in a bit later?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.60,0:26:16.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它种得有点晚
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.24,0:26:17.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.24,0:26:17.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.16,0:26:20.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's now putting up all these little shoots here, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.16,0:26:20.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它现在冒出了这些小嫩芽 这里 你看
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.12,0:26:23.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And those late-maturing ones will be a problem at harvest.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.12,0:26:23.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那些晚熟的在收割时会是个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.00,0:26:27.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There were signs that the erratic weather
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.00,0:26:29.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有迹象表明反复无常的天气 也毁了这种作物
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.52,0:26:29.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}had ruined this crop as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.84,0:26:34.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is the barley. And the problem we've got here, look...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.84,0:26:34.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是大麦 我们遇到的问题 你看
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.00,0:26:36.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look at the green in that. That's a green one.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.00,0:26:35.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看里面的绿色大麦
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.76,0:26:37.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是绿色的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.68,0:26:39.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It shouldn't be doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.68,0:26:39.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不应该这样
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.24,0:26:49.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The winter wheat was next in line for a haircut.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.24,0:26:49.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}下一个等待收割的是冬小麦
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.08,0:27:01.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Breakfast, lunch and dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.08,0:27:01.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}早餐、午餐和晚餐
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.84,0:27:11.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then, Kaleb headed over to the last of the big crops...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.84,0:27:11.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后卡莱布前往最后一种重要作物...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.72,0:27:16.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Durum wheat. Here we come.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.72,0:27:16.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}硬质小麦 我们来了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.80,0:27:23.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Where he was teamed up with the assistant combine driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.80,0:27:23.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他和其助理联合收割机司机在此合作
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.36,0:27:28.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- You all right, mate? - You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.36,0:27:28.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 早上好 伙计 - 你好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.64,0:27:31.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.64,0:27:31.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 嗯 - 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.52,0:27:33.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, you can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.52,0:27:33.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你可以
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.72,0:27:35.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Them bloody things, you don't wanna be...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.72,0:27:35.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那些该死的东西 你不...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.36,0:27:38.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They'd be better off if you could...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.40,0:27:39.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's all right. Don't worry about it. I thought I'd jump in and see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.40,0:27:39.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是啊 没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.64,0:27:42.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.64,0:27:42.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我想过来看看你 - 好的 没事
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.72,0:27:44.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一些古怪的老东西 这玩意...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.52,0:27:47.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You must... Haven't even got time to fart, I should think.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.60,0:27:50.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They still don't know how to come in, which way to come in, do they?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.64,0:27:53.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You know, we can't get the rest tipped in this trailer yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.56,0:27:55.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's still drying and what.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.84,0:27:57.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Only went to Romania, didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.36,0:28:00.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Pardon? - It's all Mrs Hasting.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.36,0:28:00.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 什么? - 那是老哈斯汀太太
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.20,0:28:03.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Simon is still in that place.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.20,0:28:03.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}西蒙在哪儿?他还在那地方...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.80,0:28:11.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, that was farming, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.88,0:28:12.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.88,0:28:12.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.88,0:28:21.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}An exhausted Kaleb finished a couple of days later.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.88,0:28:21.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}几天后 筋疲力尽的卡莱布 结束了工作
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.16,0:28:24.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But there was very little time to relax...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.16,0:28:24.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但他几乎没有时间休息...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.08,0:28:26.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.08,0:28:26.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}嘿!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.20,0:28:28.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because Charlie had returned...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.20,0:28:28.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}...因为查理回来了...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.76,0:28:31.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You haven't got a tan. Your limbs are all intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.76,0:28:31.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你没晒黑吗?你的四肢都完好无损
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.80,0:28:33.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm all here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.80,0:28:33.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我好着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.76,0:28:37.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}...And immediately wanted a catch-up on the crops.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.76,0:28:37.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}...他想立刻跟进庄稼的情况
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.84,0:28:39.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I got the spring barley in.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.84,0:28:39.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我已经把春大麦入库了 - 好的 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.08,0:28:41.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Good. I hope that makes malting.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.08,0:28:41.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 希望它们适合酿啤酒花 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.28,0:28:42.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.24,0:28:44.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's the one that's worrying me the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.24,0:28:44.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是我最担心的事
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.52,0:28:47.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Er, the durum, that must make pasta grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.52,0:28:47.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后硬质小麦 必须能达到做意大利面的等级
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.32,0:28:48.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah. Because Canada's having
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.32,0:28:48.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.24,0:28:50.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}a shocker again. It's really hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.24,0:28:50.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为加拿大又出现高温天气 非常热
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.88,0:28:53.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So the price of durum... - What is the price of durum?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.88,0:28:53.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 所以硬质小麦的价格... - 硬质小麦的价格是多少?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.56,0:28:56.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.56,0:28:56.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.68,0:28:58.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}£500, £600 a tonne. - OK, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.68,0:28:58.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 每吨五百至六百英镑 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.60,0:28:59.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You go that side.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.60,0:28:59.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你去那边
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.08,0:29:03.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}While Charlie and Kaleb were collecting samples
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.08,0:29:03.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}当查理和卡莱布收集样本
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.80,0:29:07.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to ascertain the quality of what we'd harvested,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.80,0:29:07.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}以确定我们收获的作物的质量时
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.04,0:29:10.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I was pulling together the last bits of revenue
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.04,0:29:10.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我正在整理开发非耕地计划的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.24,0:29:12.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}from farming the unfarmed,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.24,0:29:12.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}最后几笔收入
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.60,0:29:14.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}with one unexpected income stream
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.60,0:29:14.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}其中一笔意外收入
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.76,0:29:18.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}coming from what traditionally is our most jinxed crop.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.76,0:29:18.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}来自我们传统认为最倒霉的作物...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.44,0:29:20.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Heel, heel.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.44,0:29:20.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}快来 过来!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.80,0:29:22.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Potatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.80,0:29:22.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}土豆
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.08,0:29:26.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Arya, no, that's my potatoes! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.08,0:29:26.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}艾莉亚...不行!那是我的土豆 不!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.36,0:29:28.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Get off my potatoes! Go on this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.36,0:29:28.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}别在我的土豆上拉!走开 这边
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.68,0:29:31.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No. You eejits. Go on. This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.68,0:29:31.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不行!笨狗 快过来
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.52,0:29:34.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Basically, Lisa had commandeered
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.52,0:29:34.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}基本上 丽莎征用了一块
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.00,0:29:36.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}one of the fields I'd earmarked for mustard
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.00,0:29:38.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}原本计划种植芥菜的地来种土豆
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.56,0:29:38.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and planted spuds in it,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.76,0:29:43.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because she wanted to have another crack at making crisps.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.76,0:29:43.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为她想再尝试一次制作薯片
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.84,0:29:47.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Do you know how many crisps people eat in England every year?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.84,0:29:47.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你知道在英国 人们每年要吃多少薯片吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.08,0:29:48.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- No. - Six billion.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.08,0:29:48.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 不知道 - 六十亿
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.76,0:29:51.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Six billion packets of crisps? Packets.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.76,0:29:51.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 六十亿包还是六十亿片? - 包
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.72,0:29:54.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- It's small wonder Lineker's so rich. Yeah, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.72,0:29:54.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 难怪莱因克尔这么有钱 - 好吃的薯片 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.16,0:29:57.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This all sounded very exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.16,0:29:57.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这听起来太令人兴奋了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.88,0:30:00.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But working out how we stood financially
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.88,0:30:00.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但在计算我们的财务状况时
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.76,0:30:04.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}triggered another bout of Diddly Squat maths.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.76,0:30:04.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}引发了新一轮 迪丽斯库阿特农场数学讨论
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.32,0:30:07.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So we've got 50 tonnes. That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.32,0:30:07.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我们有五十吨 那是...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.44,0:30:12.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, one tonne is a hundred thousand kilos, isn't it? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.44,0:30:12.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一吨等于十万千克 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.04,0:30:13.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.04,0:30:13.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.72,0:30:15.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- What's one tonne?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.72,0:30:15.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一吨等于多少?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.60,0:30:18.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}A thousand kilogrammes. - A thousand kilogrammes is one tonne.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.60,0:30:18.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 一千千克 - 一千千克等于一吨 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.04,0:30:18.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.88,0:30:21.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So it's half a million grammes
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.88,0:30:24.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以五十万克除以120
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.72,0:30:24.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}divided by 120.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.12,0:30:27.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So you should be getting...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.12,0:30:28.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 应该是四千... - 四百万...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.16,0:30:28.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Four million...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.16,0:30:31.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, 4,200 packets of crisps out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.16,0:30:31.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不对 这里能生产四千两百包薯片
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.28,0:30:33.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How do you... No!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.28,0:30:33.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你怎么...那...你...不对
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.20,0:30:35.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There's a million grammes in a ton.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.20,0:30:35.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一吨是一百万克
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.64,0:30:37.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So it's 50 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.64,0:30:37.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以是五十万 我可能把小数点数错了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.52,0:30:39.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I may have got my decimal point wrong. - I think you might have.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.52,0:30:39.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我觉得你可能算错了 - 四十万包
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.76,0:30:41.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- 400,000 packets of crisps. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.76,0:30:43.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是四百一十六万包
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.80,0:30:43.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No. That'll be 4,160,000...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.76,0:30:45.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Lisa, your business plans are worse than mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.76,0:30:45.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你的商业计划比我的还糟
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.60,0:30:46.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.60,0:30:48.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我们看看芥末酱的数量 - 我还没算过
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.68,0:30:47.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Let's see your numbers on mustard. - I haven't done them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.00,0:30:49.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How do you know you're going to be ahead?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.00,0:30:50.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你怎么知道能做多少? - 在我脑子里
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.56,0:30:50.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's in my mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.60,0:30:52.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Eventually, we agreed
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.60,0:30:55.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}最终 我们同意 土豆能给我们带来一些收获
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.36,0:30:55.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the potatoes would bring in... something or other.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.12,0:31:00.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then, I set off with my trailer,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.12,0:31:00.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后 我开着拖车出去
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.08,0:31:04.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to harvest the mustard fields Lisa hadn't commandeered.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.08,0:31:04.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在丽莎没征用的芥菜田里进行收割
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.80,0:31:12.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ooh. This is gonna be tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.80,0:31:12.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这个入口会很窄
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.60,0:31:21.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I think that will just about get the tractor through,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.60,0:31:21.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得这大概刚好能让拖拉机通过
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.20,0:31:24.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but what about the trailer?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.20,0:31:24.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但拖车呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.96,0:31:32.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.44,0:31:39.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Shit...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.44,0:31:39.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.32,0:31:48.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What the hell am I going to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.32,0:31:48.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我现在该怎么办?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.44,0:31:55.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, how are we gonna get the combine in?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.44,0:31:57.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我们怎么把联合收割机开进去? - 你怎么把拖拉机移开?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.88,0:31:57.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, how are you gonna get the tractor moved?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.28,0:32:00.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I can get that out the way. - Go on then. Can you move this?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.28,0:32:00.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我们把它开走 - 那你去吧 你能移开这车吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.20,0:32:03.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because I'm properly stumped on that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.20,0:32:03.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为我彻底被绊住了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.56,0:32:09.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Don't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.56,0:32:09.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这...别那样...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.52,0:32:12.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.72,0:32:17.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I did not think of doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.72,0:32:17.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我没想到那么做
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.92,0:32:22.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I did not think of doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.92,0:32:22.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这我倒是没想到
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.40,0:32:27.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Bollocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.40,0:32:27.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}该死
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.00,0:32:30.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Stu...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.00,0:32:30.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}别动...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.04,0:32:32.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Fucking hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.04,0:32:32.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他妈的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.92,0:32:36.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Theres's drivers and there's screwdrivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.92,0:32:37.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}司机有新老之分 你就是新司机
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.28,0:32:37.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And you're a screwdriver.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.96,0:32:40.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, I forgot I could lift it up. That would have got it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.96,0:32:40.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不是...我忘了我可以把它抬起来 这样就能通过了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.92,0:32:42.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah. - But I forgot I could lift it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.92,0:32:42.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是啊 - 但我忘了我能把它抬起来
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.76,0:32:45.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How are we gonna get that in, though, more importantly?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.76,0:32:45.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我们怎么把它开进来? 这个问题更重要
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.60,0:32:47.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.36,0:32:53.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The problem with planting crops on ground that's not usually farmed,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.36,0:32:53.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在通常不用来耕种的土地上 种植作物就会出现这种问题
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.44,0:32:56.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and I should have realised this,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.44,0:32:56.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我本来应该想到的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.16,0:32:57.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}is that none of the gates
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.16,0:33:00.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这些大门 都不是为现代农业机械设计的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.76,0:33:00.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}are designed for modern farm machinery.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.16,0:33:08.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, Simon and Kaleb had to make a long and irritating detour.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.16,0:33:08.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以西蒙和卡莱布不得不绕道 走又长又烦人的弯路
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.60,0:33:10.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.60,0:33:10.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.40,0:33:12.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.40,0:33:12.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.44,0:33:17.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then, to get into the actual mustard field,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.44,0:33:17.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后为了进入真正的芥菜地
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.24,0:33:19.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we had to smash a fence down.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.24,0:33:19.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们不得不撞开围栏
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.20,0:33:26.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Er, right. What are we doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.20,0:33:26.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 我们要做什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.68,0:33:31.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This was the field where, five months earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.68,0:33:31.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是五个月前
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.80,0:33:36.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Kaleb had been less than impressed by my planting skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.80,0:33:36.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布对我的种植技术 不以为然的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.44,0:33:39.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look, you started drilling here, and then you come along.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.44,0:33:38.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看 你开始在这里种植
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.04,0:33:39.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后 你跟我来
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.56,0:33:40.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Fucking great miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.56,0:33:40.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}漏了好大一块地
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.04,0:33:43.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh look, another miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.04,0:33:43.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看 又漏了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.96,0:33:46.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But, now we were here,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.96,0:33:50.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但现在我们站在这里 对我而言 结果已经很惊人了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.40,0:33:50.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to me, the results looked pretty impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.08,0:33:57.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, once Simon had finished combining,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.08,0:33:57.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以西蒙用联合收割机收割完后
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.16,0:34:02.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I brought my trailer in, ready to receive my load.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.16,0:34:02.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我立刻把我的拖车开进去 准备装货
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.56,0:34:08.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There's the fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.56,0:34:08.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}风扇开启
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.24,0:34:11.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And here comes the mustard. There it is, look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.24,0:34:11.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}芥末来了 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.72,0:34:14.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There's tonnes of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.72,0:34:14.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看啊!好多啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.64,0:34:23.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.64,0:34:23.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这就没了?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.96,0:34:27.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.96,0:34:27.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.28,0:34:36.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, I guess I better cancel the speedboat order.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.28,0:34:36.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得我最好取消快艇订单
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.16,0:34:40.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Having readjusted my financial expectations,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.16,0:34:40.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}调整了我的财务预期后
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.76,0:34:44.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I set about turning the few seeds I did have
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.76,0:34:44.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我开始把手头的几粒芥末籽
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.40,0:34:46.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}into a delicious mustard.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.40,0:34:46.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}变成美味的芥末酱
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.32,0:34:48.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What I've done so far
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.32,0:34:48.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}到目前为止 我所做的是
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.76,0:34:54.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}is put 1.3 litres of vegetable oil in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.76,0:34:54.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把1.3升的植物油倒进去
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.08,0:34:57.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm now going to add, for 40 jars,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.08,0:34:55.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我现在要加...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.64,0:34:57.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是做四十罐的量
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.32,0:35:01.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}2.2 litres of cider vinegar.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.32,0:35:01.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}2.2升的苹果醋
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.32,0:35:05.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I can see why James May decided to do a cookery show.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.32,0:35:05.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道詹姆斯梅 为什么决定做烹饪节目了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.88,0:35:09.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You just sit down and put things in jars.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.88,0:35:09.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}只要坐下来 往罐子里加东西就行
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.68,0:35:13.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Bee juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.68,0:35:13.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}蜂蜜
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.28,0:35:15.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Cider!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.28,0:35:15.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}苹果酒
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.76,0:35:18.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ah! 400 millilitres.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.76,0:35:18.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}四百毫升
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.48,0:35:21.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I may have overdone it with the cider but it'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.48,0:35:21.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}苹果酒可能放多了 但没事
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.40,0:35:23.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Light, soft brown sugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.40,0:35:23.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}浅色软红糖
