Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.12,0:39:55.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because some of it, as it says, it's just dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.12,0:39:55.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}其中一些就像测试结果说的 已经死了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.84,0:39:59.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So it doesn't have the required germination.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.84,0:39:59.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以它没有所需的发芽
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.16,0:40:00.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So what does it mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.16,0:40:00.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以这是什么意思?我们不能...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.68,0:40:03.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It means we can't use it for malting barley.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.68,0:40:03.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}意思是我们不能用这些大麦 来酿啤酒花
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.40,0:40:06.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Fucking hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.40,0:40:06.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我的妈呀
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.88,0:40:09.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How are we gonna make the beer?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.88,0:40:09.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那我怎么酿啤酒?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.44,0:40:13.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.64,0:40:15.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And again, just forgetting the beer for the moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.64,0:40:15.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且 先不说酿酒了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.80,0:40:18.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}what would we have achieved had we sold it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.80,0:40:18.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果我们卖掉大麦能获利多少?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.64,0:40:21.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There are about 180 tonnes of barley.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.64,0:40:21.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}大约有 180 吨大麦
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.92,0:40:23.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And it would have gone for...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.92,0:40:23.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它本来可以卖...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.32,0:40:26.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}235.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.32,0:40:26.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}235英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.32,0:40:27.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- A tonne. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.32,0:40:27.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 一吨? - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.40,0:40:30.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So we'd have got £42,000,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.40,0:40:31.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以如果我们把大麦送去奥克斯顿 就能赚四万二千英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.16,0:40:31.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}if we could have sent it down to Hawkstone.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.84,0:40:32.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.84,0:40:32.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.76,0:40:35.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- And what are we going to get? - 160?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.76,0:40:35.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我们实际能卖多少? - 160
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.00,0:40:38.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}As animal feed again?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.00,0:40:38.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}又是动物饲料
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.28,0:40:41.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- 28,000, so we've lost... - 14,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.28,0:40:41.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 两万八 所以我们损失了... - 一万四
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.76,0:40:44.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}14,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.76,0:40:44.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一万四
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.80,0:40:47.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So we've lost 14,000 on the barley.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.80,0:40:47.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以大麦我们损失了一万四
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.96,0:40:49.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- 30,000... - 34,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.96,0:40:49.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 三万... - 硬质小麦四千
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.64,0:40:53.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}34,000 on pasta wheat.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.64,0:40:53.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}意大利面小麦三万四
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.64,0:40:56.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Barley is a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.64,0:40:56.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}大麦是个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.04,0:40:58.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That is a big problem. I've gotta ring the brewery now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.04,0:40:58.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是个大问题 我现在得给酿酒厂打电话
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.56,0:41:02.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Your durum wheat, unless we can improve that a little bit,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.56,0:41:02.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你的硬质小麦 除非品质能稍微改进一下
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.84,0:41:05.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which it might improve in store, it sometimes does,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.84,0:41:05.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}可能在储存时会有所改善 有时确实会...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.08,0:41:08.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}it's feed wheat.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.08,0:41:08.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}否则它得当饲料小麦了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.28,0:41:11.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But I'm not in full despair of this yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.28,0:41:11.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我还没有对此彻底绝望
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.28,0:41:14.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, it's all fucking terrible news.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.28,0:41:14.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}全都是他妈的坏消息
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.92,0:41:16.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, we've... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.92,0:41:16.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以如果我...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.28,0:41:19.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. I'm not enjoying this job this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.28,0:41:19.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没错 今年这工作 我做得可不太开心
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.52,0:41:26.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}To cheer myself up after this dire forecast,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.52,0:41:26.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在得知这些可怕的预测之后
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.64,0:41:31.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I decided it was time to spring a nice surprise on Lisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.64,0:41:31.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我决定给莉莎一个惊喜 来让自己振作起来
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.00,0:41:34.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, on a lovely sunny day, I drove us over to see Tim,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.00,0:41:34.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以在一个阳光明媚的日子里
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.44,0:41:38.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the cow farmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.44,0:41:38.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我开车载我们俩去见蒂姆 那位养牛的农民
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.32,0:41:42.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.32,0:41:42.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}跟我来
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.56,0:41:45.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I like a little bit of a run-out. Aw! I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.56,0:41:45.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我喜欢外出活动
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.00,0:41:46.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道
