Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.64,0:41:50.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.12,0:41:53.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Pepper!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.12,0:41:53.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}胡椒!
