Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.36,0:41:55.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 不可能吧! - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.04,0:41:58.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- We haven't seen her for a year - Of course it is. Look at her face.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.04,0:41:58.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我们已经一年没见过它了 - 你看 看看它的脸
