Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.80,0:42:01.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 真是个大惊喜... - 是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.36,0:42:03.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That is Pepper's calf.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.36,0:42:03.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是胡椒的孩子
