Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.48,0:42:08.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 太不可思议了 - 胡椒怀孕了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.04,0:42:08.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Pepper got pregnant.
