Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.48,0:42:11.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是胡椒的孩子!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.48,0:42:13.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Little...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.48,0:42:13.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}小家伙!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.64,0:42:17.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You are the cutest little thing. You are a sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.64,0:42:17.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你真可爱 - 你是最可爱的小东西
