Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.60,0:42:20.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看看小迪丽胡椒
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.36,0:42:23.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Really good-looking calf.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.36,0:42:23.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这小牛长得真好看
