Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.56,0:42:32.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Pepper, well done. You look fantastic as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.56,0:42:32.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}胡椒 干得好 你看起来也很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.64,0:42:37.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, because when I said to Charlie,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.64,0:42:37.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 因为当我跟查理说
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.08,0:42:39.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}what will happen to Pepper when all the mothers...
