Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.40,0:42:40.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Could we send them back to Tim?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.40,0:42:40.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 嗯 -“能把它们送回蒂姆那里吗?”
