Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.76,0:42:44.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他说:“我不会问 你不想听到答案的问题”
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.32,0:42:48.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Imagine my surprise when, nine months later...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.32,0:42:48.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}想象一下 九个月后 现在我们来到这里有多惊喜...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.64,0:42:51.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's the best surprise you could have given me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.64,0:42:51.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是你能给我的最好的惊喜
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.64,0:42:53.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Aw!
