Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.64,0:42:57.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你到底是怎么做到的?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.84,0:42:59.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The same bull that was at yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.84,0:42:59.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 就是你农场的那头公牛 - 不是吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.44,0:43:00.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No. The same bull?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.44,0:43:00.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 同一头? - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.64,0:43:02.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Maestro? Yeah, Maestro.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.64,0:43:02.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 大师? - 对 大师
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.48,0:43:04.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Breakheart? Breakheart Maestro.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.48,0:43:04.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 心碎大师? - 心碎大师
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.64,0:43:07.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What, you mean we brought her back here and she got up the duff immediately?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.64,0:43:05.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}什么?你是说它...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.64,0:43:07.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们把它送到这里 它就怀孕了?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.64,0:43:09.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. About a month afterwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.64,0:43:09.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 大约在来这里一个月后
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.04,0:43:11.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's a bit rude, to be honest, Tim.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.04,0:43:11.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}说实话 这有点无礼 蒂姆
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.40,0:43:14.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- She didn't like Oxfordshire, yeah? - She didn't like Oxfordshire.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.40,0:43:13.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 它不喜欢牛津郡 - 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.12,0:43:14.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它不喜欢牛津郡
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.52,0:43:16.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}She's moved back into Northamptonshire. Yeah, she doesn't like...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.52,0:43:16.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 它搬回北安普敦郡 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.76,0:43:20.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}She doesn't like the Oxford District Council.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.76,0:43:18.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它不喜欢...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.32,0:43:20.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不喜欢牛津郡议会
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.92,0:43:22.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, so a little heifer calf. That's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.92,0:43:22.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 这是一头小母牛犊 - 太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.88,0:43:25.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And Rose and Harry have called her Tabatha.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.88,0:43:25.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}罗丝和哈里叫它塔巴莎
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.20,0:43:27.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Tabatha? Or Tabby for short. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.20,0:43:26.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 塔巴莎? - 塔巴莎
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.40,0:43:27.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}或者简称为塔比
