Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.76,0:43:29.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那... - 它很有个性
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.32,0:43:30.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是吗? - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.40,0:43:31.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Pepper and Tabby. - Pepper and Tabby, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.40,0:43:31.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}胡椒和塔比
