Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.84,0:50:40.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好的 现在我们把钱加起来? - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.48,0:50:42.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Now can we do the adding up? This is the important thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.48,0:50:42.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 这很重要 - 绿笔右下方?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.16,0:50:45.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, green pen, bottom right. - You've gotta beat 27,600.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.16,0:50:46.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 必须多于27600才能... - 2...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.80,0:50:46.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, 200...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.24,0:50:49.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.24,0:50:49.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.28,0:50:53.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And 27,998.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.28,0:50:53.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}...27998
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.44,0:50:56.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- So your total, at the top, is 44,000...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.44,0:50:56.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以卡莱布 在顶端
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.56,0:50:59.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}He's beating me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.56,0:51:01.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 写上44987 - 他赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.44,0:51:01.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}987.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.40,0:51:03.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, there you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.40,0:51:03.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.52,0:51:04.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Wooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.24,0:51:06.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well done. First year of being farm manager
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.24,0:51:06.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}干得好
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.56,0:51:10.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and you've kicked my arse completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.56,0:51:10.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第一年当农场经理 你就彻底赢了我
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.44,0:51:11.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But we're a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.44,0:51:11.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我们是一个团队
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.48,0:51:15.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So if we add those two together... 40, 50...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.48,0:51:15.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以如果我们把两边加起来 4、5...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.00,0:51:16.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}72,5.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.00,0:51:16.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}72500
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.28,0:51:18.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}72. £72,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.28,0:51:18.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 72... - 七万二千英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.64,0:51:20.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Well, I mean, that is pretty... A thousand acres.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.64,0:51:22.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那... - 一千英亩 平均每英亩72英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.76,0:51:22.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's £72 an acre.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.76,0:51:25.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We can go to the pub today then.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.76,0:51:25.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那今天要去酒吧庆祝下吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.12,0:51:27.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But, Kaleb, as you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.12,0:51:29.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但是卡莱布 如你所知 农场总需要现金 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.24,0:51:29.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}farms always demand cash, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.60,0:51:31.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And we've started next year's cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.60,0:51:31.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我们已经开始了下一个周期 - 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.52,0:51:33.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So actually, I need all of that to fund the seed,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.52,0:51:33.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以其实 我需要所有钱
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.16,0:51:36.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- the fertiliser and the sprays. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.16,0:51:35.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}来购买种子、肥料
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.44,0:51:36.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 还有喷雾剂... - 什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.84,0:51:38.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- So we can't go to the pub? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.84,0:51:38.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 所以我们不能去酒吧? - 不行
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.64,0:51:42.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- What, you need every single penny? Every single penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.64,0:51:40.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你需要一分一厘?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.36,0:51:41.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一分一厘
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.56,0:51:47.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The seed, ferts and sprays. That's not even covering the contracting charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.56,0:51:44.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}下一年的种子、肥料、喷雾剂
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.12,0:51:47.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那些钱甚至都不够支付承包商的费用
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.24,0:51:50.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, I'll take you for a pint then.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.24,0:51:50.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我带你去喝一杯
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.68,0:51:52.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'll tell you something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.68,0:51:52.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我再告诉你一件事 如果我没有开发非耕地
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.88,0:51:55.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If I hadn't have farmed the unfarmed, we'd be in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.88,0:51:56.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我们会有麻烦的 - 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.92,0:51:57.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.88,0:51:59.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The other thing as well
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.88,0:51:59.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还有件事 再次申明
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.52,0:52:03.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}is that, again, I'm in the fortunate position of having other income streams.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.52,0:52:03.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我很幸运有其他收入来源
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.20,0:52:10.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But if you're a normal farmer and this is your full-time and only job,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.20,0:52:10.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但如果你是一个普通农民 而且这是你唯一的全职工作
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.12,0:52:14.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}you get two years where you don't make any money...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.12,0:52:14.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你有两年根本赚不到钱
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.20,0:52:15.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah. - You're screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.20,0:52:15.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是啊 - 你完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.84,0:52:17.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's really tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.84,0:52:17.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这真的很难
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.40,0:52:21.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because of the fluctuations we saw in the price of wheat
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.40,0:52:21.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为我们看到小麦的价格波动
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.24,0:52:24.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- and in the price of fertiliser... Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.24,0:52:24.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 化肥价格也在波动... - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.04,0:52:26.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You don't know where you are. You can't plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.04,0:52:26.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你不知道自己的处境 无法计划
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.80,0:52:31.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Literally a butterfly can flap its wings in China and you go bankrupt.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.80,0:52:30.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}说真的 一只蝴蝶在中国拍打翅膀
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.16,0:52:31.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}都可能导致你破产
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.36,0:52:33.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's that nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.36,0:52:33.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这太疯狂了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.40,0:52:37.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You used to have a relatively stable income
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.40,0:52:37.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你以前在津贴方面
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.88,0:52:40.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}in terms of subsidies but they're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.88,0:52:40.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有相对稳定的收入 但津贴会减少 真的很难获得...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.68,0:52:42.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- It's really hard to... I'd like to think
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.68,0:52:42.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我认为农业的未来充满光明
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.92,0:52:45.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the future of farming is bright and light for young generations coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.92,0:52:45.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}年轻一代加入其中 尤其是我
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.88,0:52:47.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Especially me! I'm 25 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.88,0:52:47.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我25岁 - 但怎么个光明法?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.36,0:52:49.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've got maybe potentially 60 harvests left.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.36,0:52:49.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我可能还能经历60个收获季
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.44,0:52:50.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.44,0:52:50.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}怎么可能?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.84,0:52:53.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't know! I honestly don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.84,0:52:53.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不知道 真的不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.04,0:52:53.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- How? But I want to stay positive
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.04,0:52:53.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}怎么可能?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.96,0:52:56.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because I love what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.96,0:52:56.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我想保持乐观 因为我喜欢我做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.96,0:53:02.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm gonna speak to the president again. The Prime Minister, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.96,0:53:02.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我会再跟总统聊聊 抱歉 是首相
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.84,0:53:04.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}President! Fucking hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.84,0:53:04.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他妈的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.96,0:53:07.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}President...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.96,0:53:07.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}总统
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.40,0:53:13.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It was hard, giving Charlie every penny we'd made
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.40,0:53:13.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把我们赚的一分一厘都给查理
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.48,0:53:17.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to buy seed and fertiliser for the following year.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.48,0:53:17.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}去买下一年的种子和肥料 令人很难接受...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.64,0:53:22.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because it meant we'd been through a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.64,0:53:24.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为这意味着我们经历了这么多 却一无所获
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.80,0:53:24.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to earn nothing at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.76,0:53:28.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ Well I think it's fine ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.76,0:53:28.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}关门通知
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.56,0:53:32.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ Building jumbo planes ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.72,0:53:35.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ Or taking a ride ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.20,0:53:39.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ On a cosmic train ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.48,0:53:45.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ I know we've come a long way ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.20,0:53:48.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ We're changing day to day ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.32,0:53:56.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ But tell me, where do the children play? ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.00,0:54:01.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ When you crack the sky ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.88,0:54:05.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ Scrapers fill the air ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.76,0:54:09.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ But will you keep on building higher ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.72,0:54:12.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ Til there's no more room up there? ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.56,0:54:16.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ I know we've come a long way ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.76,0:54:20.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ We're changing day to day ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.52,0:54:25.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ But tell me, where do the children play? ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.48,0:54:37.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yup. It had been yet another tumultuous year.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.48,0:54:37.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没错 又是纷乱的一年
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.32,0:54:41.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But, as is now customary,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.32,0:54:41.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但按照惯例
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.60,0:54:45.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Team Diddly Squat gathered to mark its passing...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.60,0:54:45.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}迪丽斯库阿特团队 齐聚在树林里野餐...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.40,0:54:49.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}With a picnic in the woods
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.40,0:54:52.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}纪念这一年的逝去 而地方刚好在不太成功的项目旁
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.40,0:54:52.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}next to one of my lesser triumphs.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.12,0:54:56.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Dam's not quite finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.12,0:54:57.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 堤坝还没完成 - 你们看
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.40,0:54:57.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look at it!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.92,0:54:59.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You know we've gone backwards. I was about to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.92,0:54:59.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们已经倒退了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.16,0:55:01.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Have you actually started it? It's such a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.16,0:55:01.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我正要说你们真的开始修了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.64,0:55:02.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That is a disgrace, to be honest. Both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.64,0:55:02.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}真是一团糟
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.64,0:55:07.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's like a pair of children have been playing down there, innit?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.64,0:55:04.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}老实说 对你们俩来说都是羞耻
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.72,0:55:07.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就像是俩孩子在这里玩一样 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.32,0:55:08.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.32,0:55:08.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是的 - 什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.64,0:55:11.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's exactly what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.64,0:55:11.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.12,0:55:13.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.52,0:55:17.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Dogs are still untrained.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.52,0:55:17.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}狗还没训练好
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.60,0:55:19.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You are filthy! No, go away. Go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.60,0:55:19.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你太脏了 - 不行 走开
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.64,0:55:23.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I was thinking the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.64,0:55:23.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我有天在想
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.68,0:55:27.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Farmers moan. Often with good reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.68,0:55:27.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}农民的抱怨通常都有合理的理由
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.84,0:55:31.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Bloody difficult. Don't get much pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.84,0:55:31.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}太难了 收入不多
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.40,0:55:34.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Get lambasted by everybody for harming the environment.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.40,0:55:34.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}被所有人痛斥破坏环境
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.84,0:55:38.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Why are they fighting to keep the industry going?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.84,0:55:36.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们为什么还在坚持?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.24,0:55:38.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们为什么还努力 让这个行业存在下去?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.28,0:55:40.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You know, why would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.28,0:55:40.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在该问你们为什么还在坚持?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.72,0:55:44.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then I remembered you saying four years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.72,0:55:44.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后 我记得四年前
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.28,0:55:46.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"It's a way of life, farming."
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.28,0:55:46.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你说务农是一种生活方式
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.88,0:55:48.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- You'd agree. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.88,0:55:48.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你同意吗? - 同意
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.24,0:55:51.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. I mean, you know, in the first year I went,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.24,0:55:51.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没错 第一年 我在考虑
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.36,0:55:54.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Shall I go back to London or shall I stay here?"
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.36,0:55:54.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“我应该回伦敦 还是留在这里?”
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.16,0:55:56.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It doesn't even enter my head...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.16,0:55:56.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}后来我再也没有过这种想法 没有...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.16,0:55:58.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Oh, fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.16,0:55:58.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}该死!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.48,0:56:02.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It doesn't even enter my head now.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.48,0:56:02.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我现在完全没这想法了 - 没有了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.40,0:56:05.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, I've gotta go to London next Tuesday...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.40,0:56:05.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我下周二得去伦敦
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.32,0:56:08.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm already dreading it and trying to think of excuses for not going.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.32,0:56:06.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我已经开始害怕了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.68,0:56:08.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}正在想着找借口不去
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.24,0:56:11.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- You know you went away to Africa? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.24,0:56:11.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你之前去非洲时... - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.24,0:56:12.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I hate to admit this. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.24,0:56:12.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我不愿承认... - 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.88,0:56:14.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I kinda missed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.88,0:56:14.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我有点想你
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.88,0:56:19.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The plane's gonna crash just as you say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.88,0:56:19.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你这话说的 怕是太阳打西边出来了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.52,0:56:21.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}When you said "kind of"...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.52,0:56:21.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你说“有点” 真的吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.76,0:56:22.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.76,0:56:24.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我很想他这个人 但不想他来农场帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.72,0:56:24.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I missed him as a person, not his helping on the farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.32,0:56:27.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- What do you want, Kaleb? - Our little cup of teas,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.32,0:56:27.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你想要干什么 卡莱布? - 我们的茶
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.08,0:56:29.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}our little chats, our meal out on the weekend, our chit-chats,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.08,0:56:29.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们闲聊 周末出去吃饭
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.52,0:56:33.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}farming chats, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.52,0:56:33.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}闲聊 聊农业 还有...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.28,0:56:35.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- You do need that community around. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.28,0:56:35.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你确实需要农民这个群体 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.80,0:56:37.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You do need that sort of... Otherwise, it's quite a lonely...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.80,0:56:37.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你的确需要... - 这很重要
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.44,0:56:39.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.44,0:56:39.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 没错 - 否则 这很孤单...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.24,0:56:42.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And we've had the usual year of rows, difficulties,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.24,0:56:42.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道 我们度过了平常的一年
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.32,0:56:46.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}bad weather, disappointments, deaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.32,0:56:46.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}遇到了各种困难、恶劣天气 失望、死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.44,0:56:49.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The pigs were just awful. Baroness and so on.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.44,0:56:49.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}猪的事很糟糕 男爵夫人等等
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.44,0:56:51.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But, let us look at it this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.44,0:56:51.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但让我们从这个角度来看
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.00,0:56:55.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I became a grandfather for the first time,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.00,0:56:57.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}自从我们上次来到这里以后 我第一次当上了外公
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.56,0:56:57.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}since we were last here.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.32,0:56:59.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You became a father again.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.32,0:56:59.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你又当了父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.00,0:57:01.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And you,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.00,0:57:04.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而你杰拉德 战胜了癌症
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.96,0:57:04.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the G Dog, beat the Big C.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.64,0:57:05.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.64,0:57:05.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 说得没错
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.68,0:57:07.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We can drink to that. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.68,0:57:07.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我们要为此干杯 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.04,0:57:08.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Cheers. Well done, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.04,0:57:08.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 干杯!各位 干杯 - 干得好 伙计 干得好
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.64,0:57:10.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well done, well done. - Cheers. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.64,0:57:12.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 谢谢 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.88,0:57:12.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Well done. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.96,0:57:14.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- And thank you. You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.96,0:57:14.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 谢谢 - 不客气
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.92,0:57:18.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Thank you everybody for helping to make this the best job in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.92,0:57:18.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}各位 谢谢你们帮忙 让这变成了世界上最好的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.76,0:57:21.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I would like to thank everybody,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.76,0:57:21.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我要感谢大家
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.32,0:57:24.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}all the film crew and all of my friends here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.32,0:57:24.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}感谢摄制组的所有人和每个... 我这里的所有朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.60,0:57:28.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All of you have been so kind to me and my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.60,0:57:28.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你们都对我和我的家人非常友好
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.40,0:57:31.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.40,0:57:31.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.16,0:57:33.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Gerald, that's brilliant. We're here for you all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.16,0:57:33.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你太棒了 - 我们一直都支持你
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.16,0:57:35.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.16,0:57:36.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 很好 干杯! - 干得好!干杯!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.20,0:57:36.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.08,0:57:37.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Cheers, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.08,0:57:37.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}干杯 各位
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.04,0:57:46.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ I was born in the wagon of a travelin' show ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.04,0:57:46.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}演员包括...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.08,0:57:48.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ My mama used to dance for the money they'd throw ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.64,0:57:52.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ Papa would do whatever he could ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.64,0:57:52.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}艾伦
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.88,0:57:56.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ Preach a little gospel ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.88,0:57:56.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}艾莉亚和珊莎
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.64,0:57:59.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ Sell a couple bottles of Doctor Good ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.64,0:57:59.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}安迪
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.88,0:58:04.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ Gypsies, tramps, and thieves ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.88,0:58:04.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}杰拉德
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.48,0:58:06.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ We'd hear it from the people of the town ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.32,0:58:10.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ They'd call us gypsies, tramps, and thieves ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.32,0:58:11.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}查理
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.40,0:58:13.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ But every night all the men would come around ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.04,0:58:17.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ And lay their money down ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.04,0:58:17.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}丽莎
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.04,0:58:20.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ I never had schoolin' but he taught me well ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.60,0:58:23.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ With his smooth southern style ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.80,0:58:25.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ Three months later, I'm a gal in trouble ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.88,0:58:29.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ And I haven't seen him for a while ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.88,0:58:29.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.84,0:58:37.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ I haven't seen him for a while ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.84,0:58:37.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}和杰里米
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.16,0:58:39.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ She was born in the wagon of a travelin' show ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.16,0:58:39.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一切尽在
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.92,0:58:45.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ Her mama had to dance for the money they'd throw ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.92,0:58:45.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}克拉克森的农场
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.36,0:58:49.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ Grandpa'd do whatever he could ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.36,0:58:52.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ Preach a little gospel ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.64,0:58:56.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ And sell a couple bottles of Doctor Good ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.92,0:58:59.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ Gypsies, tramps, and thieves ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.68,0:59:02.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ We'd hear it from the people of the town ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.52,0:59:06.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ They'd call us gypsies, tramps, and thieves ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.60,0:59:10.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ But every night all the men would come around ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.32,0:59:13.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ And lay their money down ♪
